  "name": "Faith Talents (Ex/Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a cleric gains experience, he learns a number of talents that assist him in manipulating spells and maintaining faith. At 2nd level and every two levels thereafter (through 10th level), a cleric gains one faith talent. A cleric cannot select an individual talent more than once. Talents marked with an asterisk (*) add effects to a cleric's spellcasting ability; only one such talent can be applied to an individual spell, and the decision must be made before the spell is cast.</p>",
